  m_text: "Spline Instantiate places instances of the prefab. Edit the prefab and every lamp along the spline follows. Each copy can also turn with the curve, so the lamp heads keep facing the road on a bend.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You open the Lamp-Post prefab and change its head. What happens to the lamps along the road?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Double-click Lamp-Post in this sample's Prefabs folder and change the head's material.\n2. Go back to the scene and look along the road.\n3. In Spline Instantiate, set Align To to World Space, then back to Spline Element.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Unity basics, Assets-And-Prefabs 4 \xB7 Prefab and instance</color></size>"
